<title>USA: Medical Resources buys Rancho Cucamonga.</title>
<headline>Medical Resources buys Rancho Cucamonga.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Resources Inc announced today that it has acquired a diagnostic imaging center located in Rancho Cucamonga, California for $3.0 million, $2.5 million in cash and $500,000 in Medical Resources common stock.</p>
<p>The center's annual revenues approximate $3 million. The company expects the transaction to be immediately accretive to earnings per share.</p>
</text>
